   :dependencies #{:1-t1a010 :1-t1a004}},
  :1-t1a008
  {:statement
   "By Lemma 4, applying $T^{\\otimes n}$ splits each $X_S$ into $2^{|S|}$ Paulis of equal coefficient magnitude $2^{-|S|/2} \\cdot |\\hat{f}(S)|$. The squared coefficients become $\\frac{\\hat{f}(S)^2}{2^{|S|}}$ for each of $2^{|S|}$ Paulis.",
   :taint :clean,
   :parent nil,
   :content-hash "d90c396e8aed86b5",
   :display-order 8,
