  :1-t1a006
  {:statement
   "**Part (i): Entropy increase.** By Lemma 1, $L_f = \\sum_S \\hat{f}(S) Z_S$. By Lemma 2, $H^{\\otimes n} L_f (H^{\\otimes n})^\\dagger = \\sum_S \\hat{f}(S) X_S$ (Hadamard maps $Z_S \\to X_S$).",
   :taint :clean,
   :parent nil,
