  :1-t1a013
  {:statement
   "**Theorem 1 Complete.** All three parts established: (i) $H(\\tilde{L}_f) = H(f) + \\mathrm{Inf}(f)$, (ii) $\\mathrm{Inf}(\\tilde{L}_f) = \\mathrm{Inf}(f)$, (iii) $\\frac{H(\\tilde{L}_f)}{\\mathrm{Inf}(\\tilde{L}_f)} = \\frac{H(f)}{\\mathrm{Inf}(f)} + 1$. QED.",
   :taint :clean,
   :parent nil,
