  :1-t1a003
  {:statement
   "By Lemma 5 (Weight Preservation), for any product unitary $U$: $\\mathrm{Inf}(U A U^\\dagger) = \\mathrm{Inf}(A)$. Applying this twice: $\\mathrm{Inf}(\\tilde{L}_f) = \\mathrm{Inf}(T^{\\otimes n} H^{\\otimes n} L_f (H^{\\otimes n})^\\dagger (T^{\\otimes n})^\\dagger) = \\mathrm{Inf}(L_f)$.",
   :taint :clean,
