  :1-t1a009
  {:statement
   "This is exactly the setup of Lemma 6 (Entropy of Uniform Splitting) with $\\pi = $ Pauli spectral distribution after $H^{\\otimes n}$ (where $\\pi(X_S) = \\hat{f}(S)^2$) and $k_S = 2^{|S|}$ (splitting factor for each $X_S$).",
   :taint :clean,
