   "By Lemma 1, the Pauli spectral distribution $\\pi_{L_f}(Z_S) = \\hat{f}(S)^2$ (with all other Paulis having zero weight). Thus $\\mathrm{Inf}(L_f) = \\sum_S |S| \\cdot \\hat{f}(S)^2 = \\mathrm{Inf}(f)$ by Definition 8.2.",
